# Sword of Wealth and Power: "When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell." The equipped Ornithopter
# hits Bot2 on turn 3 (Treasure made, copy waiting, Delayed.Count = 1) and no instant or sorcery is cast that turn: the delayed
# ability ends with the turn (Delayed.Count = 0), so Bot1's Lightning Bolt on turn 5 is not copied (Bot2 20 -> 18 -> 15).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Sword of Wealth and Power
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x17

